WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:02.168
- The 2020 All-Star Game.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:05.463
- I tell ya what,&nbsp;this is fun.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:06.673
- This is gettin' good, people.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.050
- As a fan, we love competition

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.802
and they are competing right now.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:14.264
- This is amazing to me
to just see the intensity.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.558
- Everyone is out of their seats.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.351
- I haven't seen this much&nbsp;excitement

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.729
in an All-Star Game maybe ever.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:25.483
- It's the 69th annual&nbsp;
NBA All-Star Game.

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:27.527
- You know, you sometimes
take&nbsp;it for granted.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.319
You know what I mean?

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.280
But it's nothing like the&nbsp;
camaraderie being here with

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.281
all the guys.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:32.699
And it's always an honor&nbsp;
and a privilege.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:37.328
- Team Giannis wearing No. 24&nbsp;
in tribute to Kobe Bryant.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:40.832
Team LeBron wearing No. 2 on&nbsp;
the back of their uniform in

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:44.294
tribute to Kobe's&nbsp;
daughter Gianna.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:47.756
- Part of the new format,
each&nbsp;quarter is worth $100,000

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:51.217
that goes to the charity of
the winning team's choice.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.262
- And here's LeBron whipping&nbsp;
crosscourt. Kawhi Leonard.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:00:56.806
Yes! From downtown.

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:59.392
- Back-to-back threes here...

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.019
for the Terminator.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.688
- Giannis Antetokounmpo&nbsp;with the stuff.

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:06.399
Now, things have opened&nbsp;up a bit.
[Crowd cheering]

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.734
It's a reverse jam!&nbsp;

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:11.738
And on the alley-oop, AD,
Anthony Davis.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.948
- Kemba Walker gettin' hot here early.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:16.618
- It's a three-point
fest goin' on out here.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:19.954
- LeBron from way downtown!
- [Laughing]

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.959
- Harden with the leap. Beautifully done.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:26.461
- I can't jump that high.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.798
- Ooh.
- Ahhh!

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:32.008
- Yeah, Luka!

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.137
- As Leonard hits his third three
of this first quarter.

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:38.932
Here's Leonard really feeling&nbsp;it. Again! 

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.433
Trae Young gets it down low.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.144
Yes. Giannis!&nbsp;
- Ooh.&nbsp;

00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:45.855
- How 'bout the pass there,&nbsp;
though, from Luka Doncic?

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:47.899
- The lead for Ben Simmons!

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:48.900
- And a steal.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.152
- And he takes the distance. 

00:01:51.152 --> 00:01:53.446
And off the steal, it's Harden.

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.741
Oh, the setup for Jayson Tatum!

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:58.326
- What a pass by Ben Simmons.

00:01:58.326 --> 00:01:59.869
- Tatum!

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:04.290
What a beautiful pass. 
Jokic&nbsp;with the setup.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.919
Paul... oh! For Simmons.

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:10.713
And with Team LeBron
winning&nbsp;the first quarter,

00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:12.757
$100,000 goes to

00:02:12.757 --> 00:02:15.051
Chicago Scholars charity.

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.428
On to the second quarter.

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:21.683
- There's gotta be some type of&nbsp;sense
of urgency for Team Giannis to get

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:25.270
a win in one of these quarters&nbsp;
to reward his charity as well.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.313
- Giannis is right back.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.150
- And that looked like a sense of&nbsp;
urgency right there!

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.236
- [All exclaiming]&nbsp;

00:02:34.028 --> 00:02:36.698
- OK, Devin Booker.&nbsp;
- Little bounce.

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:38.533
- Oh, what a move!

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.368
- Tape those ankles.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:42.453
- Kemba Walker!

00:02:42.453 --> 00:02:44.414
- Easy. Easy, Sabonis.

00:02:45.081 --> 00:02:49.043
- Westbrook...with the leap!
[Crowd cheering]

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.505
Chris Paul showing his hops.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.215
- At 35!

00:02:54.215 --> 00:02:58.303
- Beautiful pass, and Giannis puts&nbsp;
it down. And he has erupted

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:00.305
here in the second quarter now.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:03.224
- Look how hard he's&nbsp;playing, though.&nbsp;&nbsp;
- It's all Giannis here in

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:04.392
the second quarter.

00:03:04.392 --> 00:03:07.395
- Oh, the blocked shot&nbsp;there by Gobert.
- Oh!&nbsp;

00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:12.275
And back tap by LeBron, another
opportunity. Leonard for three.

00:03:12.275 --> 00:03:14.611
Kawhi Leonard.
- Wow.

00:03:15.778 --> 00:03:19.240
On fire.
- He's in NBA Finals&nbsp;mode right now.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.783
- Kawhi Leonard again.

00:03:20.783 --> 00:03:22.744
He's 7-of-8 from downtown.

00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:24.412
- No more threes.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:25.455
- Don't deny me.

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:26.623
- No more threes, bro.

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:28.208
- Y'all gonna deny me?&nbsp;

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.835
- Yeah. Box-and-one.&nbsp;

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:36.549
- Lowry off the backboard, and&nbsp;
Middleton with the bucket.

00:03:37.258 --> 00:03:40.553
- Did he go through the&nbsp;
legs here? The nutmeg?

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:43.765
 He sure did.
- He's done that a lot this season.

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:47.101
- So the Giannis squad leads&nbsp;36-25.&nbsp;

00:03:47.101 --> 00:03:49.103
Can't hit the three– oh!!!

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:52.190
It is put down by Gobert.

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:56.611
- That's his range.
- Young from center court.
[Buzzer]

00:03:56.611 --> 00:03:57.820
Yes!

00:03:57.987 --> 00:04:01.241
But Team Giannis has defeated&nbsp;
Team LeBron in the second quarter.

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:05.495
$100,000 go to the&nbsp;

00:04:05.495 --> 00:04:08.373
After School Matters charity.

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:10.333
Third quarter just underway.

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:13.002
And here's Embiid passing on&nbsp;a three.

00:04:13.002 --> 00:04:15.463
- Oh, look at this.&nbsp;
- Oh, took a little step or two.

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:18.716
[Laughing]
- Or three or four.

00:04:18.716 --> 00:04:20.426
- Kemba Walker right back.

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:21.427
- He's just unguardable.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.263
I don't know what you do.

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:25.014
- I don't know what you do either.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.017
- Giannis! For Embiid.&nbsp;

00:04:28.685 --> 00:04:31.187
Well, Team Giannis off to&nbsp;
the strong start.

00:04:31.187 --> 00:04:34.399
Here's Kawhi Leonard hitting&nbsp;
a three.

00:04:34.399 --> 00:04:36.150
That is his eighth.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:39.195
- LeBron has a scowl on his face&nbsp;
right now here to start this

00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:41.239
third quarter, talking about&nbsp;
the guys,

00:04:41.239 --> 00:04:42.699
hopefully amping it up.

00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:44.951
- Doncic...for three.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:45.576
Yes.

00:04:46.744 --> 00:04:50.498
And there's a three-pointer by Giannis.

00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:53.376
And there's Doncic right back&nbsp;
from downtown.

00:04:54.752 --> 00:04:57.171
Another shake-and-bake from Joel Embiid.

00:04:57.171 --> 00:05:00.842
- That's a 7-footer, people,
with a&nbsp;little windmill windup.&nbsp;

00:05:01.175 --> 00:05:04.220
- Oh!!
- It's LeBron James!

00:05:04.595 --> 00:05:08.474
- What a beautiful
move in the open floor there.&nbsp;

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:11.728
- Pretty pass, and Gobert&nbsp;puts it down.

00:05:13.354 --> 00:05:16.941
Nice pass for him- 
and Simmons&nbsp;with the finish!

00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:20.278
Trae Young. Oh what a pass!

00:05:20.278 --> 00:05:23.698
Here's Young. 
You see Westbrook talking&nbsp;to him.

00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:27.160
And Young able to blow by!
- Ohh!

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:31.748
- Simmons hit the floor after&nbsp;
that dunk on the rebound.

00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:33.333
- Tatum with the pass there.

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:35.293
- Over the head to Simmons!

00:05:35.293 --> 00:05:38.713
- This is an important two minutes&nbsp;
here to try to win this quarter

00:05:38.713 --> 00:05:41.591
and that hundred thousand&nbsp;
for your charity.

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:44.093
- And the game is tied.

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:47.764
And Gobert with the stuff!

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:49.891
- This is good. Everyone's up.

00:05:49.891 --> 00:05:51.601
- Jokic for three.

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:52.810
Yes.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.897
It's a two-point lead to Team LeBron.

00:05:55.897 --> 00:05:58.816
- Are they going to go 
for the win or the tie?

00:05:58.816 --> 00:06:00.860
- Young—oh!

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:04.906
Gobert with the stuff,
and the game is tied.

00:06:04.906 --> 00:06:06.824
As this fourth&nbsp;
quarter gets underway,

00:06:06.824 --> 00:06:10.787
the target score:&nbsp;
157. No clock involved.

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:15.500
- And, Reggie, I like this&nbsp;
target score. It's like a pickup game.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.542
- Yes.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:20.922
- First team to 157 wins the game.

00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:24.425
- Westbrook with the finish.

00:06:24.425 --> 00:06:27.804
- And Chris Paul continues&nbsp;
the hot hand.

00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:30.765
- Team Giannis here struggling
here to&nbsp;start this fourth.

00:06:30.765 --> 00:06:32.892
- Five blue players in the paint.

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.436
- Now, these teams are
playing&nbsp;hard right now.

00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:38.898
Here's Paul. He's been hot
from three and does it again.

00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:43.736
- And look who's getting ready to check in.
The cavalry for Team LeBron.

00:06:43.986 --> 00:06:45.696
- Lebron... trying to spin.

00:06:45.696 --> 00:06:47.824
- Oh!
- Rejected by Giannis.

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:51.411
- Here's your defense you wanted.&nbsp;
Three hundred thousand's on the line here.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:52.829
- And Team Giannis up by six.

00:06:52.829 --> 00:06:55.832
- And they are, what, 
13 away&nbsp;from the win?

00:06:55.832 --> 00:06:58.126
- Davis rejected by Giannis!

00:06:58.126 --> 00:07:00.294
But Davis right back.

00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:04.507
Gets it to Paul in the corner—&nbsp;
and he knocks it down!

00:07:04.507 --> 00:07:05.842
Another three.

00:07:05.842 --> 00:07:08.594
Team Giannis up by three.

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:12.515
- And look at LeBron James&nbsp;
playing defense right there.

00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:14.600
- Play by LeBron

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.353
and Giannis went down.

00:07:18.062 --> 00:07:20.148
Intercepted by Leonard.

00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:21.899
Leonard moving on Lowry.

00:07:21.899 --> 00:07:22.859
[whistle]

00:07:22.859 --> 00:07:27.238
It is an offensive foul. A charge on Kawhi.
- He finally got it!

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:29.157
- Kyle Lowry finally got&nbsp;
the offensive foul,

00:07:29.157 --> 00:07:31.075
something you rarely see.

00:07:31.075 --> 00:07:34.537
You got to admit: The intensity&nbsp;
and the level of play has

00:07:34.537 --> 00:07:36.539
picked up here in the fourth.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.834
- Harden from the corner...

00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:41.419
hits a three.

00:07:41.419 --> 00:07:42.462
- Race to 11 now.

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:44.922
- So they're tied at 146.

00:07:44.922 --> 00:07:46.382
- Race to 11.

00:07:46.382 --> 00:07:47.800
- Leonard

00:07:48.217 --> 00:07:52.972
dumps it down low. Oh! A gorgeous&nbsp;
reverse by Anthony Davis.

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:56.350
- To see these guys play with&nbsp;
this kind of intensity,

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:58.853
to go out and compete
on both ends of the floor—

00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:00.938
this is beautiful to watch.

00:08:00.938 --> 00:08:06.444
- Team Giannis up 150-148.
Leonard with the pull-up.

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:07.612
Yes.

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:09.989
- Team LeBron with a
chance to go ahead here.

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:12.909
- Davis with the stuff!

00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:14.452
Embiid backing in.

00:08:14.452 --> 00:08:17.830
Nice fake on LeBron by Embiid. Wow.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:21.250
- Both teams now five away from the win.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.795
- Rebound Embiid. 
And Leonard took it away.

00:08:25.087 --> 00:08:26.714
- You can't tell me these guys&nbsp;
aren't into it.

00:08:26.714 --> 00:08:29.133
Look at the bench. 
Look&nbsp;at both benches.

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:31.427
They've been up this&nbsp;
whole fourth quarter.

00:08:31.427 --> 00:08:33.596
- All right. Here's LeBron.

00:08:33.971 --> 00:08:35.723
- [All exclaiming]
- Rejected!

00:08:35.723 --> 00:08:37.850
They want a goaltend. Let's see.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.436
- The call on the floor&nbsp;
was "good basket."

00:08:40.436 --> 00:08:43.648
Is there enough
evidence to overturn that?

00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:45.650
This is so close.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.859
- They'll jump it up.

00:08:46.859 --> 00:08:50.321
- No basket.
And LeBron cannot believe it.

00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:54.909
- Harden. No foul called. And now
we get a call. He hooks—

00:08:54.909 --> 00:08:58.538
- [All exclaiming]
- Will not count. Will not count.

00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:00.206
Even with the late call.

00:09:00.206 --> 00:09:02.875
- Wow. This is unbelievable.

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:05.127
- Back comes Team LeBron.

00:09:05.127 --> 00:09:07.755
Again needing a three for the win.

00:09:08.339 --> 00:09:10.883
Spins away, and hammers it down.

00:09:10.883 --> 00:09:13.469
- That's OK. You're still in the game
if you're Team Giannis.

00:09:13.469 --> 00:09:16.055
- Embiid backing James.
[whistle]

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:19.141
- We got a call. Foul on LeBron.

00:09:19.767 --> 00:09:22.853
- So, Embiid hits on both.

00:09:22.853 --> 00:09:26.190
- And essentially, next basket wins.

00:09:27.191 --> 00:09:28.818
- LeBron played by Giannis.

00:09:28.818 --> 00:09:30.778
- Captains guarding one another.

00:09:30.778 --> 00:09:32.947
- There's a pass to Davis!
[whistle]

00:09:32.947 --> 00:09:35.074
And we get a whistle. A foul is&nbsp;called.

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:38.035
So, Davis to the line. He can win it.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:41.372
[Laughing]
- Look at LeBron saying it's over.

00:09:41.372 --> 00:09:46.085
- Joel Embiid trying to&nbsp;
get in to Davis' mind right now.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.213
- [All exclaiming]
- Uh oh! Uh oh!

00:09:49.213 --> 00:09:51.841
- Wait a minute.
- Misses on the first.

00:09:51.841 --> 00:09:54.302
A pressure free throw for Davis.

00:09:56.429 --> 00:09:58.097
Oh! Team LeBron has won it.

00:09:58.389 --> 00:10:01.976
- But way to make it interesting there, 
Anthony Davis.

00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:05.938
- An All-Star Game that has to be&nbsp;
considered very successful

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:08.858
because of what took
place in the fourth quarter.

00:10:08.858 --> 00:10:12.862
- I loved the intensity
I saw in this fourth quarter.

00:10:12.862 --> 00:10:19.619
- But this fourth quarter is probably&nbsp;
one of the best fourth quarters in 25 years.

